============================================================
econcausal - PACKAGE LEAFLET
Active component: text-prior hybrid causal discovery
Form: Python package, command-line administration
============================================================

Read all of this leaflet before you run the package. Keep it: you may need to
read it again. The numbers reported below were measured on the in-package
planted-signal cohort and are stated with the tolerance you should expect.


1. WHAT econcausal CONTAINS
---------------------------------------------------------------
The active pipeline reconstructs directed macroeconomic transmission structure
by fusing causal hypotheses extracted from policy text with constraint-based
statistical discovery on time series, then contrasts the recovered structure
across economic regimes.

  Compartment    Module        Action
  -----------    ------        ------
  keel           keel.py       typed graph / triplet / regime containers
  slipway        slipway/      planted-signal cohorts, FRED-style series,
                               BnLearn-sized benchmark DAGs
  loft           loft/         cue-grammar extraction, k-pass voting,
                               sign / temporal / accounting constraints
  frames         frames/       text-derived prior weight matrix W_r
  hull           hull/         NOTEARS-with-prior, PC, PCMCI, DirectLiNGAM,
                               dual-threshold edge retention
  rigging        rigging/      graph edit distance, Jaccard, permutation test,
                               transmission-path ranking
  sea_trials     sea_trials/   F1 / precision / recall / SHD, interaction
                               ratio, paired t, Cohen d, Holm, bootstrap
  drydock        drydock/      seeding, atomic checkpoints, distributed init,
                               run loop
  blueprint      blueprint/    frozen-dataclass schema + YAML loader
  helm           helm/         command line: fit appraise chart trace export


2. WHAT econcausal IS USED FOR
---------------------------------------------------------------
Three stages run in sequence. Stage one reads economic sentences and returns
voted, constraint-filtered causal triplets. Stage two folds those triplets into
a statistical backend as an informative prior and keeps an edge when it clears a
dual significance threshold (standard threshold with text support, ten-fold
stricter without). Stage three builds one graph per regime and quantifies the
structural change with graph edit distance, Jaccard overlap and a conditional
permutation test.


3. BEFORE YOU USE IT - WARNINGS AND PRECAUTIONS
---------------------------------------------------------------
The reference run profile is heavy and is not reduced by any quick path. The
pytest profile drawings/experiment/_smoke.yaml exists only for the test suite.

  Quantity            Reference value
  --------            ---------------
  accelerators        8 x A100 80GB SXM, DDP
  effective batch     49152  (64 x 96 x 8)
  learning rate       2e-6
  warmup steps        2000
  epochs              6000
  precision           fp32
  pinned runtime      torch 1.13.1 + cu117, python 3.8, CUDA 11.7, numpy <2

Precaution: the evaluation cohort is synthesised from a planted directed acyclic
ground truth. Reported scores describe recovery of that planted structure, not a
claim about real central-bank corpora. The live language client raises unless an
authorised provider session is present; the offline cue-grammar extractor is the
default.


4. POSOLOGY AND METHOD OF ADMINISTRATION
---------------------------------------------------------------
Install (one of):

  pip
    python -m pip install -r requirements.txt
    python -m pip install -e .

  conda
    conda env create -f environment.yml
    conda activate econcausal
    python -m pip install -e .

  docker
    docker build -t econcausal .
    docker run --rm econcausal --help

Administer:

  econcausal fit      --config drawings/experiment/main.yaml
  econcausal appraise --config drawings/experiment/main.yaml
  econcausal chart    --config drawings/experiment/main.yaml
  econcausal trace    --config drawings/experiment/main.yaml
  econcausal warmup   --config drawings/experiment/main.yaml
  econcausal export   --config drawings/experiment/main.yaml -o artifacts/objective.onnx

Multi-accelerator run:

  bash yardwork/launch_train.sh drawings/experiment/main.yaml

Dose adjustment is by dotted override, for example:

  econcausal fit --config drawings/experiment/main.yaml --set backend.method=pcmci


5. PHARMACOLOGICAL PROPERTIES (EXPECTED READINGS)
---------------------------------------------------------------
Readings on the planted-signal cohort. The reference profile draws 20 seeds; the
five-seed proxy below converges to the same band.

  Endpoint                     Command                                                  Expected
  --------                     -------                                                  --------
  headline edge F1             econcausal appraise --config .../main.yaml               0.77 +/- 0.08
  text-data interaction ratio  econcausal fit --config .../main.yaml                    0.44 +/- 0.10
  PC backend edge F1           econcausal appraise --config .../ablation_backend_pc.yaml 0.79 +/- 0.08
  regime difference            econcausal chart --config .../main.yaml                  GED > 0, p < 0.05
  transmission paths           econcausal trace --config .../main.yaml                  ranked instrument->target chains
  solver warmup                econcausal warmup --config .../main.yaml                 last < first


6. INTERACTIONS - EXTERNAL DATA SOURCES
---------------------------------------------------------------
The planted-signal cohort needs no download. The structured and text resources
the method targets are listed, with reachability-checked links, in
ships_stores.txt:

  resource                       role
  --------                       ----
  bnlearn bnrepository           Asia / Child / Alarm ground-truth DAGs
  ReCITE (arXiv 2505.18931)      text-to-graph causal benchmark
  EconCausal (arXiv 2510.07231)  economic causal reasoning benchmark
  FRED                           macroeconomic time series
  FOMC minutes, ECB speeches     central-bank text corpora
  NBER working papers            academic economic text


7. POSSIBLE UNDESIRABLE EFFECTS
---------------------------------------------------------------
- The acyclicity constraint forbids contemporaneous feedback; mutually causal
  pairs are removed by the accounting-identity filter rather than represented.
- Direction is resolved by partial-correlation magnitude and prior support;
  near-symmetric pairs may be oriented either way.
- Recovery degrades as variable count rises against a fixed series length.
- The permutation null uses the constraint-based backend for tractability even
  when the main backend is the continuous solver.


8. STORAGE AND QUALITY CONTROL
---------------------------------------------------------------
  ruff check .
  black --check .
  isort --check-only .
  mypy econcausal
  python -m pytest

The suite spans shape, planted-DAG recovery, acyclicity, edge filtering, voting,
constraints, graph distances, permutation calibration, metric agreement with
scipy, determinism, gradient flow, command line, the training smoke, and a
source-style guard.


9. MARKETING AUTHORISATION HOLDER
---------------------------------------------------------------
Released under the MIT licence (see LICENSE). The pipeline reports causal
structure and regime change; it does not issue forecasts, trades, or policy
recommendations. Trained weights are available on reasonable request.
